      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 6,
          "section": "2",
          "quote": "the diffusion-mediated climb allows the trapped dislocations to bypass the γ′ precipitates at high temperatures. Dislocation climb is an alternative mechanism of dislocation motion that allows an edge dislocation to move perpendicular to its slip plane.",
